重释放漏洞 CVE-2026-125350 已被在野利用","2026-11-12",15,"ConnectWise 调查针对 MSP 的 ScreenConnect 恶意软件活动，47 家组织受影响","2026-11-13",16,"攻击者利用 4,837 个劫持 GitHub 账户在 1,806+ 个仓库运行 CI 密钥窃取器","2026-11-14",17,"攻击者利用 PHP2Shell 入侵 Check Point 网关并部署 VMware ESXi 数据擦除器","2026-11-15",18,"CISA 将 Check Point 与 UnrealIRCd 漏洞 CVE-2026-123039、CVE-2026-114713 加入 KEV 目录","2026-11-16",19,"FBI 警告 ARTEX AI 渗透测试框架被用于全球多行业攻击","2026-11-17",20,"Rapid7发现CVE-2026-90436已被用于攻击Atlassian Confluence Data Center和N-able N-central","2026-11-18",21,"OpenJDK Java4Shell 漏洞 CVE-2026-114938 可导致 RCE，Oracle 已发布补丁","2026-11-19",22,"OpenJDK 披露 Base64 解码远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-114938","2026-11-20",23,"VMware vCenter 认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123890 已被 ARMORY CASTLE 利用","2026-11-21",24,"Microsoft Outlook 欺骗漏洞 CVE-2026-124194 已复现并遭在野利用","2026-11-22",25,"CISA 将 Apache Roller、Cisco Expressway、SAP NetWeaver 和 VMware vCenter 四项漏洞列入 KEV","2026-11-23",26,"Artifex Ghostscript -dSAFER 沙箱绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-125396 已复现","2026-11-24",27,"GT13 攻击活动入侵 Check Point Security Management Servers，至少影响 22 家组织","2026-11-25",28,"BabidiGhost 借助越狱 AI 代理攻击欧洲多行业机构并窃取 8.6 GB 档案",29,"GeoServer 未认证远程代码执行漏洞链 CVE-2026-129242 等已复现","kind","daily","安全日报 · 2026-11-24","generatedAt","2026-11-24T00:00:30.885Z","lead",{"_54":124,"_283":260},"leadItemId","iem1v1rdf735rh87a15ydka7e","overview","highlights",[280,281,282],"sections",[196,197,198,199],"flashes",[165,166],"cover",{"_158":159,"_160":161,"_162":-5,"_163":-5,"_164":-5},"metrics",{"_153":69,"_154":63,"_155":156,"_157":156},"readingMinutes","prev","next","totalEvents","sourcesCount","modelsReleased",0,"firstPartyEvents","url","/dailyinfo/media/e6aabac43b52fa87.webp","srcSet","/dailyinfo/media/d455178a882f4a84.webp 720w, /dailyinfo/media/7dd6e49fc00f2734.webp 1200w, /dailyinfo/media/e6aabac43b52fa87.webp 1600w","width","height","caption",{"_167":186,"_54":187,"_170":188,"_172":189,"_174":190,"_176":191,"_178":192,"_180":193,"_182":183,"_184":185,"_194":47,"_195":110},{"_167":168,"_54":169,"_170":171,"_172":173,"_174":175,"_176":177,"_178":179,"_180":181,"_182":183,"_184":185},"itemId","kt28hyz5su4474tak5rdyu83s","Dragos 称至少三家 AI 推理服务商遭入侵，客户提示与 AWS 测试密钥被窃","summary","Dragos 通过在 7 月至 11 月向常用 AI 服务发送约两百万条含 URL、主机名和 AWS 密钥等诱饵的提示，发现至少三家 AI 推理服务商遭入侵且均未自行察觉。","sourceName","SecurityWeek","sourceUrl","https://www.securityweek.com/ai-inference-providers-failed-to-detect-hacking-and-prompt-theft-says-dragos/","publishedAt","2026-11-23T12:16:20.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/c2a91b85de7bb9d6.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"pgxndxlk0pc1jfszvzjw1m6zy","Cisco Expressway 漏洞 CVE-2026-76466 已被用于攻击，CVSS 9.8","Cisco Expressway 的硬编码凭据漏洞 CVE-2026-76466 已被用于真实攻击，CISA 于 11 月 20 日将其加入 KEV，联邦机构须在 11 月 23 日前完成修补。","Infosecurity Magazine","https://www.infosecurity-magazine.com/news/critical-cisco-expressway-flaw/","2026-11-23T10:00:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp","/dailyinfo/media/6406d1b57afc7303.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp 96w","otherSources","followUp",{"_200":266,"_170":-5,"_202":267},{"_200":224,"_170":-5,"_202":225},{"_200":213,"_170":-5,"_202":214},{"_200":201,"_170":-5,"_202":203},"label","AI 安全","items",[204],{"_167":205,"_54":206,"_170":207,"_172":208,"_174":209,"_176":210,"_178":211,"_180":212,"_182":183,"_184":185},"c8wjp58mjtg86cgal7wl3xraq","CERT-In 警告 AI 辅助攻击导致印度银行与金融科技机构发生未授权付款","印度 CERT-In 警告，攻击者利用 AI 辅助网络攻击篡改企业记录、审批关系并借合法支付流程发起未授权交易，受害对象包括银行、金融服务业实体及政府关联支付平台的技术服务商，损失金额和责任主体尚未披露。","The Hacker News","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/ai-assisted-cyberattacks-trigger.html","2026-11-23T08:24:15.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","研究与披露",[215],{"_167":216,"_54":217,"_170":218,"_172":219,"_174":220,"_176":221,"_178":222,"_180":223,"_182":183,"_184":185},"ysh9eoiejcit2sca72qq4z9j7","VirtualBox 进程加固绕过 CVE-2026-87268 与 .NET 代码完整性分析","CVE-2026-87268 利用 .NET Framework v4 的程序集加载机制与 VirtualBox DLL 加载钩子，绕过受保护进程检查并加载任意代码；研究还发现，清除 PE 文件的 IMAGE_FILE_EXECUTABLE_IMAGE 标志可在 UMCI 启用时绕过 WDAC，并可经 COM 劫持攻击 PPL 进程。","Google Project Zero","https://projectzero.google/2026/11/virtualbox-process-hardening.html","2026-11-23T08:00:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/376bd4805d6f026f.webp","/dailyinfo/media/65168e6442530ad9.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/376bd4805d6f026f.webp 96w","攻击与威胁",[226,227,228,229,230],{"_167":138,"_54":124,"_170":260,"_172":261,"_174":262,"_176":263,"_178":264,"_180":265,"_182":183,"_184":185},{"_167":255,"_54":256,"_170":257,"_172":234,"_174":258,"_176":259,"_178":237,"_180":238,"_182":183,"_184":185},{"_167":247,"_54":248,"_170":249,"_172":250,"_174":251,"_176":252,"_178":253,"_180":254,"_182":183,"_184":185},{"_167":239,"_54":240,"_170":241,"_172":242,"_174":243,"_176":244,"_178":245,"_180":246,"_182":183,"_184":185},{"_167":231,"_54":232,"_170":233,"_172":234,"_174":235,"_176":236,"_178":237,"_180":238,"_182":183,"_184":185},"q18h9n20h190vesq5m40qb6vd","GlobeTopper 遭黑客入侵，攻击者盗用 $70,000 礼品卡并造成约 $2.5 million 收入损失","B2B 数字礼品卡分销商 GlobeTopper 遭网络攻击，母公司 iQSTEL 称攻击者盗取了部分客户 API 凭据与集成密钥并兑换价值 $70,000 的数字礼品卡，预计造成约 $2.5 million 收入损失。","BleepingComputer","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/globetopper-loses-25-million-after-hackers-steal-70k-in-gift-cards/","2026-11-23T16:50:01.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","lyf96vda5zff8pbjkukxgohx6","Bulgaria 发现持续五年的政府网络间谍活动，130 GB 文件被窃取","Bulgaria 发现自 2021 年起持续五年的网络间谍活动，多个国际黑客组织从政府数据库下载超过 130 GB、约 6200 万页文档，涉及内阁文件、报告及部委和机构间通信。调查人员尚未确定攻击者或国家级关联，也未确认数据是否被利用；目前没有证据表明公民个人数据受影响。事件于 2026 年 8 月由新国家网络安全监测系统发现异常活动后曝光，相关部门已隔离受影响系统、阻断访问并清除恶意软件。","Security Affairs","https://securityaffairs.com/203794/intelligence/bulgaria-discovers-massive-government-breach-after-five-years-of-undetected-spying.html","2026-11-23T09:46:56.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp","/dailyinfo/media/2adef5b1e4357a03.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp 96w","msk8129yc8fadoi6jreqf6gt2","Google Ads 投放虚假 Codex 与 Claude Code 下载页面攻击 Mac 用户","Cato Networks 发现攻击者通过 Google Ads 投放 Codex、Claude Code 和 Homebrew 的虚假下载广告，利用流量 cloaking 向部分访客展示恶意安装器。","Hackread","https://hackread.com/google-ads-mac-malware-fake-codex-claude-code/","2026-11-23T18:21:45.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/dd06beac4cadc6f3.webp","/dailyinfo/media/47417cbef4636b7b.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/dd06beac4cadc6f3.webp 96w","zzi7f7xofm7gytvcqddw0dvqq","KEPCO 确认数据泄露，超过 150 万人信息被访问","Korea Electric Power Corporation（KEPCO）确认攻击者侵入内部网络，访问 KEPCO ON 电费平台和 SRM 采购系统，泄露超过 150 万人的数据。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/south-koreas-power-giant-kepco-confirms-data-breach-impacting-15-million/","2026-11-23T20:54:51.000Z","GreyNoise 发现 GT13 针对 Check Point Security Management Servers 的入侵活动，确认攻击发生于 2026 年 10 月 17 日至 11 月 2 日，至少影响全球 22 家组织，涉及 24 台受控服务器。","GreyNoise Blog","https://www.greynoise.io/blog/check-point-security-management-servers-intrusion-campaign","2026-11-22T16:00:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/2f63af78ba43c8b0.webp","/dailyinfo/media/cf5410a440ec3a6e.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/2f63af78ba43c8b0.webp 96w","漏洞与在野利用",[268,269],{"_167":275,"_54":276,"_170":277,"_172":173,"_174":278,"_176":279,"_178":179,"_180":181,"_182":183,"_184":185},{"_167":270,"_54":271,"_170":272,"_172":173,"_174":273,"_176":274,"_178":179,"_180":181,"_182":183,"_184":185,"_194":47},"k2zsycnny1ugsek91lkczs5fq","N-able 修复 Mail Assure 与 SpamExperts SSRF 漏洞 CVE-2026-134624","N-able 已修复 Mail Assure 和 SpamExperts Hosted Cloud 服务中的 SSRF 漏洞 CVE-2026-134624，该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 9.3，具备足够权限的 API 用户可迫使服务器连接任意内部主机和端口。","https://www.securityweek.com/n-able-patches-critical-flaw-disclosed-after-mail-assure-cyberattack/","2026-11-23T15:06:49.000Z","xq8xakipwwrrbp544jsizje8i","Azure API Management Classic 漏洞被用于窃取挪威能源公司密钥","Azure API Management Classic 漏洞已被用于针对挪威能源公司 Equinor 和 Skagerak Energi 等目标，攻击者可能获取了实例中存储的密钥。","https://www.securityweek.com/azure-flaw-exploited-to-target-secrets-at-norwegian-energy-firms/","2026-11-23T15:47:40.000Z",{"_167":275,"_54":276,"_170":277,"_172":173,"_174":278,"_176":279,"_178":179,"_180":181,"_182":183,"_184":185},{"_167":216,"_54":217,"_170":218,"_172":219,"_174":220,"_176":221,"_178":222,"_180":223,"_182":183,"_184":185},{"_167":270,"_54":271,"_170":272,"_172":173,"_174":273,"_176":274,"_178":179,"_180":181,"_182":183,"_184":185,"_194":47},"leadParagraph",{"_285":286,"_287":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
